Decode the DNG embedded-JPEG preview in draft mode: a click on an iPhone ProRAW file now decodes 3 MP instead of the full 48 MP sensor frame, and a 12 MP embedded frame decodes at half scale instead of full. Previews whose half-scale lands within 2% of the viewport cap now render at that half scale — up to 41 px under the 2048 cap, below one logical pixel on a 4K display at 175% (#865).
